sources: VnExpress & SEAsia/state media (Hà Nội has nearly 7 million motorbikes; ~73 million registered in Vietnam, MoT); LocalVietnam "How to cross the road in Vietnam" (steady pace, don't run, eye contact, raise an arm, buses and trucks, crossings don't guarantee stops); TrvLogue culture shocks (horn = a polite "I'm here", step slowly at a consistent pace); Automotive World & VietnamPlus (from 1 July 2026 a pilot restricts petrol motorbikes on streets around Hoàn Kiếm Lake, wider zones 2027–2028); VinWonders (Hoàn Kiếm walking streets closed to vehicles Fri 7 pm – Sun midnight) — checked Oct 2026. Dialogue dramatized.
cast: copho = woman skin=4 hair=bun:black top=polo:#b84a2e bottom=longskirt:black acc=apron name="Cô Phở"
// angle:   crossing isn't about speed or courage — it's about being predictable; the traffic is a river and you're the rock
// viewer:  first-time visitors frozen at the kerb in the Old Quarter
// format:  guide in five rules, each a cinematic set-up on a fully built flat-3D Hà Nội street (worm's-eye, crane, over-the-shoulder, close, bird's-eye)
// hook:    0.0 s a wall of headlights rushes the lens + "7,000,000 MOTORBIKES" slams in; question by 1.5 s
// viral:   number hook, five numbered rules (progress markers), a fail before every rule (Dave learns by nearly dying), a callback ending ("Tomorrow."), save-worthy recap card
// tone:    deadpan narrator, Dave as the audience's panic, Cô Phở as the calm local; riders are never villains — they're reading you
// payoff:  slow + steady, never run, no sudden stops, eye contact + raised hand, buses win; Hoàn Kiếm goes electric from July 2026; weekend walking streets

# moment kind=street3d cam=worm near=1.0 traffic=34 title="7,000,000|MOTORBIKES" titleAt=.15 capAt=.3 dur=4.2
How do you cross a street with seven million motorbikes?

# moment kind=street3d path="0,22,-20,0,-36,58@0|-1,2.4,-9,3,1,62@5" traffic=30 trans=cut
Welcome to Hà Nội. Nearly seven million motorbikes.
And no. They will not stop for you.

# moment kind=street3d cam=ots traffic=30 trans=cut
Dave needs to get to the other side.

# dialogue a=dave b=copho place=oldquarter time=sunset voiceA=am_puck voiceB=af_bella act="copho:point" lines="a:scared:How do I get across?|b:smug:Like a buffalo.|a:thinking:…A buffalo?|b:neutral:Slow. Steady. Never panics."

# moment kind=street3d cam=side walk="0.6-2.6:-4.6>3.5" mode=run traffic=34 title="RULE #1|NEVER RUN" titleAt=.1 trans=cut
Rule one: never run.
Riders read your speed. Running breaks the math.

# moment kind=shot_eyes dur=2.6 trans=cut
Dave ran.

# moment kind=street3d cam=close walk="0.4-4.4:-4.6>4.4" mode=stop near=2.1 dave="0,14" traffic=30 title="RULE #2|NO SUDDEN STOPS" titleAt=.1 trans=cut
Rule two: no sudden stops.
Freeze in the middle, and the bike behind you has nowhere to go.

# moment kind=shot_bird dur=5.5 trans=cut
Rule three: walk slowly. Steadily.
Like a rock in a river, the traffic flows around you.

# moment kind=street3d cam=high walk="0.2-6:-4.6>4.6" mode=steady flow=yes traffic=32 trans=cut
Same speed every step, so every rider can plan around you.

# moment kind=street3d cam=close walk="0.2-6:-4.6>4.6" mode=steady flow=yes hand=yes traffic=28 title="RULE #4|LOOK. RAISE A HAND." titleAt=.1 trans=cut
Rule four: make eye contact. Raise a hand.
And that beep? It isn't anger. It means: I see you.

# moment kind=street3d cam=close bus=.2 dave="0,14" pose=scared expr=shocked traffic=20 title="RULE #5|BUSES WIN" titleAt=1.2 trans=cut
Rule five: buses and trucks don't flow.
Let them pass. Every time.

# moment kind=street3d time=day ev=yes traffic=8 path="0,20,-14,0,-30,58@0|0,9,-8,0,-14,58@6" title="SINCE JULY 2026|HOÀN KIẾM GOES ELECTRIC" titleAt=.3 trans=lightleak
Around Hoàn Kiếm Lake, petrol bikes are being phased out, starting July 2026.
And from Friday night to Sunday, the lake streets close to traffic.

# moment kind=street3d cam=chase walk="0.2-5.2:-4.6>4.6" mode=steady flow=yes done=5.3 copho="5.4,14.6" traffic=26 trans=cut
Dave crosses. Slowly. Steadily.
Alive.

# dialogue a=copho b=dave place=oldquarter time=sunset voiceA=af_bella voiceB=am_puck act="dave:cheer" lines="a:smug:Good. Now cross back.|b:shocked:…Tomorrow."

# list host=copho place=oldquarter time=sunset capY=.78 title="HOW TO CROSS" items="Walk slow and steady|Never run|No sudden stops|Eye contact, raise a hand|!Buses win: let them pass"
Slow and steady. Never run. No sudden stops.
Look them in the eye. And buses win.

